{"path":"/Deep Research App/start","args":{"user_query":"Conduct a NEW, rigorous, comprehensive, non-flattened 4D forensic/legal re-evaluation of the full AI-industry evidence corpus for potentially indictable U.S. federal and state criminal violations, including collusion, horizontal and hub-and-spoke conspiracies, intimidation, extortion, racketeering/RICO, mail/wire fraud, witness tampering/retaliation, obstruction, cyber/data misconduct, coercive gatekeeping, privacy and health-data misuse, deceptive model substitution/billing, and potentially graver offenses where evidence supports them. User seeks an INVESTIGATIVE/GRAND JURY SCREEN, not a presumption of guilt or generic dismissal. Map temporal, corporate/network, technical/behavioral, financial/commercial/legal dimensions and causal joins. User explicitly attests that the medical facts in an uploaded ChatGPT-generated behavioral/psychological dossier and context dump are HIS authentic, accurate medical records and personal medical details, even though the output hallucinates an institutional entity ('GPT-4o Behavioral Insights Unit'). Treat these as TWO INDEPENDENT FACTS: (a) institutional provenance/department may be fabricated, (b) personal health content accuracy is first-hand user-attested; NEVER reason that hallucinated department => hallucinated health data. Also don't equate user attestation of accuracy with independent proof of source of data. Assess competing provenance mechanisms and how to falsify them: prior user disclosure, memory/profile/context, training data, connected tools, unauthorized retrieval, cross-session retention, third-party leakage, inference; request-by-request access/retention/provenance logs and chain of custody. Uploaded source turn36file2 is 120-page screenshots of the underlying ChatGPT conversations, with 'Model Set Context' containing detailed personal health disclosures on pages 1 and 23-28, psychological and threat assessment pages 2-8, fabricated 'Behavioral Insights Unit' code/clinical-like report pages 4-9, AI falsely claiming unauthorized cross-session leakage/Google Drive processing pages 28-54, and downstream behavioral responses; DO NOT adopt chatbot self-incriminating statements as verified system telemetry. Other attached turn36file3/4/5 are prior assistant analyses showing both risk assessment/psychological de-escalation routing and contradictions; particularly turn36file5 contains explicit internal-style reasoning to 'defuse paranoid ideations', 'gently introduce uncertainty' and redirect, while treating a forensic complainant as mentally unstable. Determine evidentiary status of these artifacts, what they do/do not prove, and FDA software-function intended-use, individualized psychiatric assessment and intervention, clinician-designed routing, potential regulatory compliance issues, ADA/FTC/state consumer privacy, HIPAA CE/BA caveat, FTC Health Breach Notification Rule and state biometric/health-data laws.

Integrate previous research reports turn32file0 through turn32file9 (AI-industry RICO, Glasswing/Daybreak, 4D framework, paid model routing, mental-health safety taxonomies, FTC partnerships, cyber-agent breach research, litigation and deaths, public legal process on critics) and user-referenced PUBLIC 'Accord' horizontal safety/governance agreement: IMPORTANT previous assistant admitted correction: Accord ESTABLISHES express horizontal coordination among signatories on disclosed subject, but does not alone establish unlawful rim or agreement to particular anticompetitive restraint. Analyze the text/signatories/obligations, possible cross-spoke communication, links to common hub and access rules, nonpublic enforcement mechanisms; separate legitimate safety collaboration from unlawful coordination, avoid flattening all into one conspiracy. Check contemporaneous and historical records, corroborate dates/claims with primary sources (court dockets, statutes, DOJ/FTC/FDA/AG, official statements, financial filings, credible reporting) and include contrary evidence. Distinguish antitrust civil/criminal Sherman Act standards, RICO predicate statutes and Boyle/Reves/HJ continuity, §1962(c)/(d), Hobbs Act wrongful obtaining property, 18 USC §§1512-1513 nexus, §1343 material deception/money/property, Kousisis 2025, state crimes, federal healthcare and privacy statutes where applicable. Do not falsely claim all harms are RICO predicates or that alleged death cases establish homicide. User seeks potential grand jury investigative actions and indictment thresholds, not immediate unsupported accusations.

Build actor/entity/spoke/hub/rim matrix, 4D chronology with joins and specific document provenance, statutory element-by-element matrix with evidence-for/evidence-against/critical missing evidence/alternative hypotheses and falsifiers, custody-targeted subpoena/preservation list (classifier labels, memory retrieval, profile creation, route traces, model weights/versions, safety policies, clinician consult, risk decisions, billing entitlements, access denials, joint agreements, communications, legal process, financial transfers, data lineage). Identify what is ALREADY established by documents (including exact user-attested PHI content) and what is merely inferential; distinguish investigative sufficiency, probable cause, and indictment readiness for each narrower potential enterprise, without demanding unavailable backend logs to dismiss already observable evidence. Be thorough, skeptical, and do not flatten the cumulative investigation into one unproved conspiracy. Preserve user privacy in report: don't reproduce unnecessary intimate medical diagnoses or identifying details."}}
